sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant UI as StudyChat
  participant TS as TanStack API route
  participant SB as Supabase
  participant SA as Local safety
  participant CTX as Context and RAG
  participant LLM as Local model
  U->>UI: Send prompt
  UI->>TS: UI messages, thread and bearer
  TS->>SB: Verify JWT and thread ownership
  TS->>SA: Moderate prompt
  alt not explicitly allowed
    SA-->>TS: block or unavailable
    TS-->>UI: 403 or 503, no message generation
  else allow
    TS->>SB: Persist user message
    TS->>CTX: Question plus scoped IDs and bearer
    CTX->>SB: Read user context through RLS
    CTX->>CTX: Retrieve, deduplicate, rerank and budget
    CTX->>LLM: Bounded prompt
    LLM-->>CTX: Answer
    CTX-->>TS: Answer, sources, tip, model, summary
    TS->>SB: Persist returned assistant bytes
    TS-->>UI: AI-SDK text and context metadata
  end
